        "Description": "Finally get that pesky achievement out of the way.\r\rWALKTHROUGH:\r\r1. Start at the harbour\r2. Go into the sewer and grab the crowbar\r3. Break into the church from below (Use lockpick or crowbar)\r4. Drop coins where the bell will fall\r5. Quickly go up the stair before the clerk sees you\r6. When the clerk goes to check out the coins, drop the bell\r7. Go down the stairs and enter the overlook inside the church\r8. Wait for the guard to pass and escape!",
